{%- comment -%}
  TIKVES LONDON . SINGLES
  One bottle per view on mobile, swipe for the next. A grid on desktop.
  Every card carries its own Add to cart button, so a customer can buy
  from the home page without opening the product page. Sold-out lines
  stay in the row and read as sold out.

  Operator ruling 4 Sep 2026: no two-column grid of bottles on the home
  page. Replaces featured-collection for the singles row and
  tikves-shelf for the rakija, and carries the Top trending row.
  Keep the section keys in tikves-home-design so band and padding apply.

  Buy button is Terra Rossa, round. The See all button is Paper with Ink
  text and an Ink outline, filling Terra Rossa on hover. The line under
  the heading is forced to body size and sentence case.

  28 Sep 2026, speed: two more sizes in the srcset, so a phone fetches the
  size nearest its screen instead of the next one up.

  23 Oct 2026, operator: on a phone the card fills the width (no peek of
  the next bottle) and a row of dashes sits under the cards, one per
  bottle. The current one is Ink, the rest a warm grey. The dashes follow
  the swipe and a tap on one goes to that bottle. Hidden on desktop, where
  the row is a grid. On a phone the picture frame is a little wider than
  it is tall, so the whole card, dashes included, fits on one screen under
  the header. Desktop keeps the 4:5 frame.
  TO UNDO: set the card back to flex 0 0 82%, sizes back to 82vw, the
  frame back to 4 / 5 everywhere, and delete the tksg__dots block, its
  styles and its script.

  24 Oct 2026, operator: By the bottle shows every wine. The How many
  products range now goes higher, and on a phone the dashes narrow and
  sit closer so a long row still fits on one line.
  TO UNDO: range max back to 12, dot min-width back to 16px, dots gap
  back to 8px.

  24 Oct 2026, operator: the card line carries the ABV from wine.abv after
  the tile line, for Google's alcohol policy (ABV on the landing page).
  TO UNDO: put the tksg__line block back to the tile line alone.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign col = collections[s.collection]
  assign per_row = s.per_row | default: 4
  assign limit = s.limit | default: 8
-%}

<div id="tksg-{{ section.id }}" class="tksg" data-section-id="{{ section.id }}" data-section-type="tikves-singles">

  {%- if s.title != blank or s.intro != blank -%}
    <div class="page-width">
      <div class="section-header">
        {%- if s.title != blank -%}
          <h2 class="section-header__title {{ s.heading_size }}">{{ s.title | escape }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if s.intro != blank -%}
          <p class="tksg__intro">{{ s.intro | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="page-width">
    <div class="tksg__track">
      {%- if s.collection == blank or col.empty? or col.products_count == 0 -%}
        {%- comment -%} Nothing to show. Renders empty rather than placeholders. {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {%- for product in col.products limit: limit -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign v = product.selected_or_first_available_variant | default: product.variants.first
            assign img = product.featured_media.preview_image
            assign line = product.metafields.custom.tile_line.value
            assign card_abv = product.metafields.wine.abv.value
          -%}
          <article class="tksg__card" data-product-handle="{{ product.handle }}">
            <a class="tksg__frame" href="{{ product.url | within: col }}">
              {%- if img != blank -%}
                {%- capture tk_src -%}{{ img | image_url: width: 800 }}{%- endcapture -%}
                {%- capture tk_set -%}{{ img | image_url: width: 400 }} 400w, {{ img | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w, {{ img | image_url: width: 800 }} 800w, {{ img | image_url: width: 1000 }} 1000w, {{ img | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w{%- endcapture -%}
                {%- if forloop.first -%}
                <img
                  src="{{ tk_src }}"
                  srcset="{{ tk_set }}"
                  sizes="(min-width: 769px) 22vw, 100vw"
                  alt="{{ img.alt | default: product.title | escape }}"
                  width="{{ img.width }}"
                  height="{{ img.height }}"
                  loading="lazy">
                {%- else -%}
                <img
                  data-tksg-src="{{ tk_src }}"
                  data-tksg-srcset="{{ tk_set }}"
                  sizes="(min-width: 769px) 22vw, 100vw"
                  alt="{{ img.alt | default: product.title | escape }}"
                  width="{{ img.width }}"
                  height="{{ img.height }}"
                  loading="lazy">
                <noscript><img src="{{ tk_src }}" srcset="{{ tk_set }}" sizes="(min-width: 769px) 22vw, 100vw" alt="{{ img.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" width="{{ img.width }}" height="{{ img.height }}" loading="lazy"></noscript>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            </a>
            <div class="tksg__meta">
              <a class="tksg__title grid-product__title grid-product__title--{{ settings.type_product_style }}" href="{{ product.url | within: col }}">{{ product.title }}</a>
              {%- if line != blank or card_abv != blank -%}
                <div class="tksg__line">
                  {{- line -}}
                  {%- if line != blank and card_abv != blank %} · {% endif -%}
                  {%- if card_abv != blank -%}{{ card_abv }} ABV{%- endif -%}
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
              <div class="tksg__price">{{ product.price | money }}</div>
              {%- if product.available == false -%}
                <button type="button" class="tksg__btn" disabled aria-disabled="true">{{ 'products.product.sold_out' | t }}</button>
              {%- elsif product.variants.size > 1 -%}
                <a class="tksg__btn" href="{{ product.url | within: col }}">{{ 'products.product.add_to_cart' | t }}</a>
              {%- else -%}
                <form class="tksg__form" action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" method="post" data-tk-gatc>
                  <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ v.id }}">
                  <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
                  <button type="submit" class="tksg__btn">{{ 'products.product.add_to_cart' | t }}</button>
                </form>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          </article>
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- if s.collection != blank and col.products_count > 1 -%}
      <div class="tksg__dots" aria-label="Choose a bottle">
        {%- for product in col.products limit: limit -%}
          <button type="button" class="tksg__dot{% if forloop.first %} is-active{% endif %}" data-tksg-dot="{{ forloop.index0 }}" aria-label="Show {{ product.title | escape }}"{% if forloop.first %} aria-current="true"{% endif %}></button>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- if s.link_label != blank and col != blank -%}
    <div class="page-width text-center tksg__link">
      <a href="{{ col.url }}" class="tksg__browse">{{ s.link_label | escape }}</a>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

{%- render 'tikves-gatc-handler' -%}
{%- comment -%}
  19 Oct 2026, speed. On a phone this row is a swipe track, so cards two
  onwards sit off to the right, but the phone still downloaded all of them
  straight away, on the same slow line as the hero photo. Their pictures
  now wait: each one loads as soon as it comes into view (desktop, where
  the row is a grid, or a swipe on a phone), and all of them load once
  the page has finished loading anyway, so a swipe never finds a blank.
  The first card loads as before. Without JavaScript the noscript copy shows.
  TO UNDO: put src and srcset back on every img and delete this script.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script>
  (function () {
    var root = document.getElementById('tksg-{{ section.id }}');
    if (!root) return;
    var imgs = [].slice.call(root.querySelectorAll('img[data-tksg-srcset]'));
    if (!imgs.length) return;
    function show(img) {
      if (!img.hasAttribute('data-tksg-srcset')) return;
      img.setAttribute('srcset', img.getAttribute('data-tksg-srcset'));
      img.setAttribute('src', img.getAttribute('data-tksg-src'));
      img.removeAttribute('data-tksg-srcset');
      img.removeAttribute('data-tksg-src');
    }
    function showAll() { imgs.forEach(show); }
    if ('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
      var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
        entries.forEach(function (e) { if (e.isIntersecting) { show(e.target); io.unobserve(e.target); } });
      });
      imgs.forEach(function (i) { io.observe(i); });
    } else { showAll(); }
    var track = root.querySelector('.tksg__track');
    if (track) {
      track.addEventListener('scroll', showAll, { once: true, passive: true });
      track.addEventListener('touchstart', showAll, { once: true, passive: true });
    }
    if (document.readyState === 'complete') showAll();
    else window.addEventListener('load', showAll, { once: true });
  })();
</script>
{%- comment -%} 23 Oct 2026: the dashes under the row follow the swipe; a tap goes to that bottle. {%- endcomment -%}
<script>
  (function () {
    var root = document.getElementById('tksg-{{ section.id }}');
    if (!root) return;
    var track = root.querySelector('.tksg__track');
    var dots = [].slice.call(root.querySelectorAll('.tksg__dot'));
    var cards = track ? [].slice.call(track.querySelectorAll('.tksg__card')) : [];
    if (!track || !dots.length || !cards.length) return;
    function step() {
      return cards.length > 1 ? (cards[1].offsetLeft - cards[0].offsetLeft) : track.clientWidth;
    }
    function current() {
      if (track.scrollLeft >= track.scrollWidth - track.clientWidth - 2) return dots.length - 1;
      var i = Math.round(track.scrollLeft / (step() || 1));
      return Math.max(0, Math.min(dots.length - 1, i));
    }
    function set(i) {
      dots.forEach(function (d, k) {
        var on = k === i;
        d.classList.toggle('is-active', on);
        if (on) d.setAttribute('aria-current', 'true'); else d.removeAttribute('aria-current');
      });
    }
    var ticking = false;
    track.addEventListener('scroll', function () {
      if (ticking) return;
      ticking = true;
      window.requestAnimationFrame(function () { ticking = false; set(current()); });
    }, { passive: true });
    dots.forEach(function (d, k) {
      d.addEventListener('click', function () {
        var c = cards[k];
        if (!c) return;
        track.scrollTo({ left: c.offsetLeft - cards[0].offsetLeft, behavior: 'smooth' });
        set(k);
      });
    });
  })();
</script>


{% style %}
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__intro {
    max-width: 46ch;
    margin: 10px auto 0 !important;
    text-align: center !important;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 15px !important;
    line-height: 1.5 !important;
    font-weight: 400 !important;
    text-transform: none !important;
    letter-spacing: 0 !important;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__track {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    padding: 0 0 8px;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__track::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__card { flex: 0 0 100%; scroll-snap-align: start; }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__frame { display: block; aspect-ratio: 7 / 6; background: #F6EEE8; overflow: hidden; }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__frame img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; display: block; }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__meta { padding: 12px 0 0; text-align: center; }
  /* 29 Oct 2026, operator, after Overtone: name, line and price centred under the bottle. */
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__title { display: block; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 0 4px; }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__line { font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.75; margin: 0 0 6px; }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__price { font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__form { margin: 0; }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__btn {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 15px 18px;
    border: 1px solid #A64029;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #A64029;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    line-height: 1.3;
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__btn:hover { background: #8E3623; border-color: #8E3623; color: #FFFFFF; }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__btn[disabled] { background: transparent; color: #1F2328; border-color: #B9AC9B; opacity: 0.7; cursor: default; }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__dots {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
    margin: 6px 0 0;
  }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__dot {
    flex: 0 1 32px;
    min-width: 6px;
    padding: 12px 0;
    margin: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
  }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__dot::before {
    content: "";
    display: block;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: #B9AC9B;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__dot.is-active::before { background: #1F2328; }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__dot:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #1F2328; outline-offset: 2px; }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__link { margin-top: 24px; }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__browse {
    display: inline-block;
    min-width: 220px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 15px 28px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #F6EEE8;
    color: #1F2328;
    border: 1px solid #1F2328;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__browse:hover,
  #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__browse:focus-visible {
    background: #A64029;
    border-color: #A64029;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }
  @media only screen and (min-width: 769px) {
    #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__intro { font-size: 16px !important; }
    #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__track {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat({{ per_row }}, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
      overflow: visible;
      padding: 0;
    }
    #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__card { flex: none; }
    #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__frame { aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; }
    #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__meta { padding-top: 14px; }
    #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__price { margin-bottom: 12px; }
    #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__dots { display: none; }
    #tksg-{{ section.id }} .tksg__link { margin-top: 32px; }
  }
{% endstyle %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Tikves singles",
  "class": "index-section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "One bottle per view on mobile with an Add to cart button on every card and a row of dashes under it. A grid on desktop." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Heading" },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "heading_size",
      "label": "Heading size",
      "default": "h3",
      "options": [
        { "value": "h3", "label": "Small" },
        { "value": "h2", "label": "Medium" },
        { "value": "h1", "label": "Large" }
      ]
    },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "intro", "label": "Line under the heading" },
    { "type": "collection", "id": "collection", "label": "Collection" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "limit", "label": "How many products", "min": 2, "max": 24, "step": 1, "default": 8 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "per_row", "label": "Products per row, desktop", "min": 2, "max": 5, "step": 1, "default": 4 },
    { "type": "text", "id": "link_label", "label": "Button label under the row", "info": "Links to the collection. Leave empty for no button." }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Tikves singles", "category": "Tikves" }],
  "disabled_on": { "groups": ["footer", "header", "custom.popups"] }
}
{% endschema %}
